{"4384810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Otrop", "steam_appid": 4384810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A struggling writer receives an unexpected call, and his destiny leads him to the small town of Otrop. Now, he must face mysteries that defy life and death in an adventure packed with supernatural fun. Write your story, pay bills, encounter ghosts, and discover the paths between dreams and reality in a journey filled with captivating characters and a town brimming with stories and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect in Retro Otrop:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Writing Loop:</strong> Explore minigames and solve puzzles to gain Inspiration, write books, and receive payments from your editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Development:</strong> An attribute system where Strength, Intelligence, and Charisma unlock new paths and dialogue options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Sim Elements:</strong> Pay bills, make friends, and uncover the secrets of Otrop's inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress Mechanics:</strong> The challenge isn't just financial, but mental. Balance work and leisure to keep your character sane and productive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> A town full of stories, locations for self-improvement, and hidden mysteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384810/extras/4e4cd67c5f991a1b8490488064290c4e.avif?t=1773678751\" width=1286 height=802 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A struggling writer receives an unexpected call, and his destiny leads him to the small town of Otrop. Now, he must face mysteries